OL,3,GNEWSACollege offers VR driving
OL,4,Asimulator to students
OL,5,
OL,6,FStudents at a college in Barnsley are
OL,7,Fto be given access to a virtual reality
OL,8,Fsimulator to hone their driving skills
OL,9,Fand save money before they hit the
OL,10,Froads.
OL,12,FThe Driver Accreditation Scheme (DAS)
OL,13,Fat Barnsley College enables them to
OL,14,Fgain their provisional licence and
OL,15,Fdriving experience by using the new
OL,16,Ftechnology.
OL,18,FAround 200 students a year will take
OL,19,Fpart in the driving academy, with
OL,20,Ffinancial support from the college.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,389,380,200,160,0,100
