OL,3,GNEWSACollege offers VR driving
OL,4,Asimulator to students
OL,5,
OL,6,FCollege principal David Akeroyd said:
OL,7,F"The cost of learning to drive is one
OL,8,Fof many barriers our students face and
OL,9,Fhas, for many, become prohibitive. In a
OL,10,Fcompetitive job market and a cost of
OL,11,Fliving crisis, we need to give our
OL,12,Fstudents every advantage to gain
OL,13,Fmeaningful, skilled employment."
